faq:
  - q: How many follow-ups is enough?
    a: Follow up until the customer decides or asks you to stop. The next date on the record keeps each lead moving without relying on memory.
  - q: Should partners' leads be treated the same?
    a: Yes, once they enter your pipeline they follow the same rules, with the partner kept informed of status.
  - q: How do we handle leads that go cold?
    a: Set a longer next date, keep them in the pipeline with a note, and review them in the weekly sweep.
